title: Authorizations › New case › Referral › Full page: Fit, Activity and notes
route: /authorizations/new/referral/RF-2053?draft=draft-1001
intro: The two read-mostly tabs, Fit (Placement's view of the level of care and the beds left) and Activity (what happened and private notes), plus the 'Add note' dialog from the header.
dir: TD
---
start s1 "Click 'Fit'"
start s2 "Click 'Activity'"
start s3 "Click 'Add note' in the header"

group gFit "Fit tab"
  screen f1 "'Level of care'\n'Placement reads the referral against the six ASAM dimensions'\n'The referral supports' PHP, 92% confident · 'Next best' IOP, 63%"
  toast f2 "Amber banner when Placement suggests another program\n'The referral asks for IOP. Placement suggests PHP.'\n'You choose the program when you accept. Placement only reads the referral. A clinician decides the level of care.'"
  screen f3 "Six dimensions, each with a note and four bars\nIntoxication and withdrawal · Medical conditions · Mood, behavior and thinking · Readiness to change · Relapse and continued use · Recovery environment"
  screen f4 "'Capacity'\n'Open this week. Accepting a referral takes one'\nOne row per program: 'PHP: 5 slots open this week', chips 'Requested' and 'Suggested', '19 of 24 full'\nRed 'no beds open this week' at zero"
  process f5 "Read only: nothing on the Fit tab can be clicked"
endgroup

group gAct "Activity tab"
  screen a1 "'Activity' 'Agents and people, oldest first'\nTimeline: received, read, checked, suggested, assigned, asked, decided\nUpcoming steps are dashed"
  screen a2 "'Notes' with the count\nAmber banner 'These notes are private and only visible to you and your team.'\n'No notes yet.' or each note with its author and time"
  input a3 "Type in 'Add a note'\nPlaceholder 'Type your note'"
  decision a4 "Anything typed?"
  process a5 "'Add note' is disabled"
  click a6 "Click 'Add note'"
endgroup

group gMod "Header 'Add note' dialog"
  overlay m1 "'Add a note'\nAmber banner 'These notes are private and only visible to you and your team. The referrer cannot see them.'"
  input m2 "Type in the box\nPlaceholder 'Type your note'"
  decision m3 "Anything typed?"
  process m4 "'Add note' is disabled"
  click m5 "Click 'Add note'"
  click m6 "Click 'Cancel' or 'Close', press Escape,\nor click outside the dialog"
  endx m7 "No note is saved"
endgroup

store n1 "Note is saved with its author and time\nTimeline 'Jordan Perez added a note' with the text"
toast n2 "'Note added'\n'Only you and your team can see it.'"
screen n3 "Notes list shows the new note first\nThe text box empties (Activity tab)"

s1 --> f1 --> f2 --> f3 --> f4 --> f5
s2 --> a1 --> a2 --> a3 --> a4
a4 -->|No| a5
a4 -->|Yes| a6 --> n1
s3 --> m1 --> m2 --> m3
m3 -->|No| m4 --> m6
m3 -->|Yes| m5 --> n1
m1 --> m6 --> m7
n1 --> n2 --> n3
